{{!
    @template mod_classprogress/entry_written

    What the entry page shows after its form, once the entry is saved: its written-on day, late flag and last-edited
    time, and the links to its history and to delete it.

    Context variables required for this template (those of mod_classprogress/entry_context):
    * hasentry - Whether the entry is saved.
    * writtenon, late, lastedited - Sentences about the saved entry; late is empty when it was not late.
    * deleteurl, historyurl - Links to delete the entry and to see its history.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "hasentry": true,
        "writtenon": "Written on 2026-10-18.",
        "late": "Late by 2 days",
        "lastedited": "Last edited Sunday, 18 October 2026, 12:00 PM.",
        "deleteurl": "https://example.com/local/classprogress/entry.php?id=1&action=delete",
        "historyurl": "https://example.com/local/classprogress/history.php?id=1"
    }
}}
{{#hasentry}}
    <p class="mod_classprogress-entry text-muted mt-3" data-region="entry-written">
        {{writtenon}}{{#late}} <span class="badge bg-warning text-dark">{{late}}</span>{{/late}} {{lastedited}}
        <a href="{{historyurl}}">{{#str}} history, mod_classprogress {{/str}}</a> ·
        <a href="{{deleteurl}}">{{#str}} deleteentry, mod_classprogress {{/str}}</a>
    </p>
{{/hasentry}}
